{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159000/extras/Capa_descri\u00e7\u00e3o.gif?t=1738981903\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage an Abandoned Farm </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159000/extras/Gif_Comprimido_-_Expandindo_a_fazenda.gif?t=1738981903\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start in debt with an abandoned farm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant different seasonal crops, harvest, and sell them to customers or directly at the market</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand and decorate the farm however you like!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage Your Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159000/extras/Mostrando_a_loja_2.gif?t=1738981903\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy a small shop in ruins and turn it into a successful business</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase the variety of items sold as you produce them on the farm</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand and decorate your shop to attract more and more customers</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire and train employees to help you sell even more</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hire Employees!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to shop employees, you can hire miners to mine for you and hunters to gather food and animal-based products!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fair Expansion!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This road connects an important trade route, making it the perfect spot for a successful fair! Watch this small fair grow into an important and wealthy trade center!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help construct new buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell products at the fair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assist the adventurer's guild to increase the fair's reputation</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore a vast world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159000/extras/Gif_Comprimido_-_Explorando_e_lutando.gif?t=1738981903\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources to craft items and expand your farm</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore different areas in search of rare items</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt animals and fight monsters to obtain valuable items</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore caves to obtain valuable ores. But be careful! The deeper you go, the more dangerous it gets!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get your dream home</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159000/extras/Mostrando_a_casa_Gif.gif?t=1738981903\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand and furnish your house, creating the home of your dreams!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Seasonal Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seasonal events last one season (28 days) and can either hinder or help the player. They affect the world the player lives in:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Financial Crisis! The price of the products the player sells drops significantly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prosperous Season! During this season, the price the player can sell products for increases!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3159000?t=1738981903","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgr